      "name": "Advanced Modding Lights",
      "slug": "advanced-modding-lights",
      "teaser": "Enhance the lighting in weapon modding and build screens for better visibility and aesthetics",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2906.jpg",
      "downloads": 6560,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<h3>Enhance the lighting in weapon modding and build screens for better realism and control. It’s good for controlling the lighting when taking screenshots. It activates a directional light which creates more reflections on the angles you choose.</h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"LYPTjbPlVvA\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/LYPTjbPlVvA?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LYPTjbPlVvA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<h3><strong>Features</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhanced Lighting: Improves lighting in weapon modding and build screens</li>\n<li>Configurable Settings: Adjust directional light brightness and rotation</li>\n<li>Real-time Updates: Settings apply immediately without restart</li>\n<li>Performance Optimized: Efficient light caching and management</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Installation</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Download the latest release</li>\n<li>Extract to your SPT folder</li>\n<li>Configure settings via F12 (Config Manager)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Configuration Options</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable Custom Lighting: Toggle enhanced lighting on/off</li>\n<li>Brightness: Control directional light intensity (0.1 - 5.0)</li>\n<li>Rotation X/Y: Adjust light direction (-180° to 180°)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For feature requests and reporting bugs, please use the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/emilanderss0n/AdvancedModdingLights\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GitHub repo</a> for this mod</p>\n",
